WEBVTT

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:25.800
The school festival's "Romeo and 
Juliet" was really wretched...

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:30.930
The greatest obstacle in a play 
is memorizing all those lines.

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:37.660
And on top of that, the dark forces from 
Dotsuku Zone barged in the middle of the play.

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:58.920
We have to save Stone Keeper 
before they find out

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:02.960
that the power of the Prism 
Stones is locked inside Pollun.

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:08.050
Misumi residence...

00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:11.280
Dad?

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:15.160
Are you serious?

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:17.820
You're kidding!

00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:20.960
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:23.760
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:26.600
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:30.870
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:30.870 --> 00:01:33.840
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:36.710
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:36.710 --> 00:01:38.610
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:42.510
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:44.120
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:49.920
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:52.020
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:55.790
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:56.790 --> 00:01:59.800
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:02.370
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:02:02.630 --> 00:02:05.540
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:08.410
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:02:08.410 --> 00:02:14.680
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:15.580
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:02:15.580 --> 00:02:18.280
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:21.090
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:21.090 --> 00:02:23.990
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:25.560
<i>Together we are</i>

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:28.630
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:02:36.290 --> 00:02:37.140
Ryota-kun!

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:38.130
Honoka-san!

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:38.730
Good morning.

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:40.630
Did you come over to play?

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:42.000
I'm sorry, Honoka...

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:44.040
I can't go shopping with you today.

00:02:44.770 --> 00:02:45.870
Why not?

00:02:45.870 --> 00:02:48.590
I just got a call from my dad,

00:02:48.590 --> 00:02:50.770
and he forgot some important papers at home,

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:53.360
so I have to go, and deliver this to him now.

00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:56.570
He's working on a Sunday?

00:02:56.570 --> 00:02:59.950
He said it's an emergency meeting 
about a new product development.

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:01.430
I know you were looking forward to this...

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:02.120
I'm so sorry.

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:05.340
Don't worry about it... It's an emergency.

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:09.200
Of all days, he had to 
forget something today.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:11.160
Keep an eye on the house, Ryota.

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:12.470
I'll go.

00:03:13.820 --> 00:03:14.930
You're going?

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:20.190
I'll take the papers to Dad, so 
you and Honoka can go shopping.

00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:23.990
You've never been to Dad's company before,

00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:25.720
so I know you'll get lost.

00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:28.400
Don't worry about me... I'm confident.

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:30.450
Stop putting on a strong front.

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:33.230
I know what it is...

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:36.540
I'll bet you're just trying to 
look good in front of Honoka.

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:38.390
No, I'm not!

00:03:38.390 --> 00:03:42.160
I'm a fifth grader now, so if I 
say I can go by myself, I'm going!

00:03:47.570 --> 00:03:52.140
"IT TAKES GUTS! 
RYOTA'S GREAT ERRAND STRATEGY"

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:58.140
Listen carefully.

00:03:58.140 --> 00:04:01.600
You have to get off at Minatobashi 
station to get to Dad's office.

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:04.310
I have the directions from the 
station written down here.

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:08.700
I know already... You told me 
the same thing three times!

00:04:10.530 --> 00:04:13.080
There are two identical 
buildings next to each other,

00:04:13.320 --> 00:04:17.080
so be sure you go to the building on the 
right when you're coming from the station.

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:18.030
I told you... I got it!

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:20.500
Don't make a mistake, Ryota-kun.

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:21.970
Okay, Honoka-san.

00:04:22.260 --> 00:04:24.440
What's with this difference 
in attitude anyway?

00:04:27.230 --> 00:04:30.890
If you run into any problems, open this.

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:33.800
What is that?

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:37.680
Never mind... Only open it 
if you're really in trouble.

00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:39.370
All right.

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:44.900
Why don't you go with him?

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:48.470
You're worried about him, aren't you?

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:52.600
It's okay... He's the one 
who offered to do it.

00:04:52.820 --> 00:04:54.920
If something happens, it'll be disastrous.

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:56.750
I'll go with you.

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:58.230
Honoka...

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.450
What is that guy anyway?

00:05:11.570 --> 00:05:12.920
What guy?

00:05:12.920 --> 00:05:15.890
That restless little creature 
that keeps running around...

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:19.820
Does it bother you that much?

00:05:20.310 --> 00:05:22.630
In that case, you should 
just smash him into bits.

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:28.650
He's the only one we have no memory of...

00:05:28.650 --> 00:05:29.570
It bothers me.

00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:33.520
Do all living things from the Field 
of Light have that kind of power?

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:37.580
I can't help feeling that he's the 
only one who has something beyond...

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:41.120
Something beyond the powers of Pretty Cure...

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:43.420
Isn't that right, Belzay Gertrude?

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:45.400
What about it Stone Keeper?

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:47.990
Answer him zakenna.

00:05:48.210 --> 00:05:50.290
I have no idea what you're talking about.

00:05:50.290 --> 00:05:51.760
Don't pretend zakenna!

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:53.990
Don't pretend zakenna!

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:57.690
I'll check on it...

00:05:57.880 --> 00:05:58.670
Huh?

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:01.650
I'll go, and check on it.

00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:02.650
What?

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:06.330
I said... I'll go and check on it!

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:16.220
Good grief! What a foolish 
thing to do all of a sudden.

00:06:16.220 --> 00:06:18.010
We'll have to find a way to let him know that

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:19.730
he's going in the wrong direction.

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:21.220
What are we going to do?

00:06:22.430 --> 00:06:23.580
I've got it!

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:25.150
I haver a favor to ask you, Mepple.

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:26.630
What is it mepo?

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:30.260
Start your love chat!

00:06:30.710 --> 00:06:33.790
Where are you taking me today mip...?

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:35.980
How about Minatobashi mep...?

00:06:36.530 --> 00:06:40.510
I'd love that, but isn't Minatobashi 
in the opposite direction mip...?

00:06:41.650 --> 00:06:43.920
What am I going to do? 
I made a mistake mep...!

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:47.710
We can just get off at the 
next station, and transfer.

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:48.830
That's a good idea.

00:06:49.160 --> 00:06:50.560
Very good... very good!

00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:52.790
What kind of love chat is that mepo?

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:55.750
Talking without using "mipo" 
is really exhausting mipo.

00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:57.100
Now... now...

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:10.330
Okay. Our strategy was a success!

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:12.820
I'm home!

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:17.420
Isn't anyone home?

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:22.230
"Dad called to say he forgot 
some papers at home,

00:07:22.230 --> 00:07:24.140
so Ryota went to deliver them to him."

00:07:24.140 --> 00:07:27.050
"I'm going shopping with Honoka... Nagisa."

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:28.960
Ryota went all by himself?

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:35.750
We're almost at Minatobashi, aren't we?

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:38.080
It looks like he'll make it safely.

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:40.400
There's darkness next door popo.

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:43.420
There's darkness next door popo.

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:51.650
I'm sorry for the commotion popo.

00:07:57.340 --> 00:07:58.520
What a surprise!

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:01.640
You mustn't come out at 
a time like this, Pollun.

00:08:02.740 --> 00:08:06.530
Didn't Pollun say something 
about darkness next door?

00:08:07.050 --> 00:08:08.660
Darkness next door...?

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:10.000
Don't tell me it's them again?

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:12.120
Darkness next door...

00:08:12.410 --> 00:08:15.450
Maybe he meant there's a 
dark warrior next to Ryota!

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:16.460
It can't be!

00:08:38.820 --> 00:08:40.150
What was that?

00:08:40.150 --> 00:08:42.200
It was a case of a stranger and "two peas 
"in a pod" (tanin no soramame ni)...

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:45.290
Don't you mean "tanin no sorani" 
(accidental resemblance)?

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:47.810
Don't get it mixed up with "a 
spitting image" (urifutatsu).

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:54.940
Ryota?

00:08:55.290 --> 00:08:57.650
I asked Nagisa to bring it.

00:08:57.860 --> 00:08:59.310
What are we going to do?

00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:01.610
I'm worried about Ryota going by himself.

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:04.820
There's no need to get excited.

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:09.740
He might call, so you'd better stay home.

00:09:09.990 --> 00:09:10.900
But...

00:09:11.120 --> 00:09:14.700
Don't worry... Ryota's in 
the fifth grade already.

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:18.680
Okay... Call me as soon as Ryota gets there.

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:20.490
I will.

00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:25.510
I wonder if he'll be okay by himself.

00:09:34.660 --> 00:09:36.650
Minatobashi... Minatobashi...

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:39.650
Looks delicious.

00:09:42.130 --> 00:09:45.100
Dad's waiting for those papers!

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:47.810
That's where he's just 
like his sister, isn't he?

00:09:53.310 --> 00:09:54.940
Wait!

00:09:58.000 --> 00:09:59.310
What am I going to do? What am I going to do?

00:09:59.310 --> 00:10:01.430
He's starting to panic!

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:02.790
Isn't there something we can do?

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:08.390
I got it!

00:10:09.730 --> 00:10:16.430
Anyone going to Takashi Misumi's office, 
please go to East Exit Number Three.

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:17.970
Nagisa!

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:19.560
What's that?

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:22.380
Let me repeat... Anyone going 
to Takashi Misumi's office,

00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:24.370
please go to East Exit Number Three.

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:26.430
East Exit Number Three?

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:27.610
Okay... that does it.

00:10:27.610 --> 00:10:28.690
Hey!

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:30.770
I'm sorry!

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:36.910
You take the cake, Nagisa.

00:10:36.910 --> 00:10:40.840
I'm sorry... I always wanted to do 
one of those station announcements.

00:10:41.050 --> 00:10:45.000
I'm sure she said there were two identical 
buildings next to each other...

00:10:48.070 --> 00:10:49.390
What a klutz!

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:51.300
Are you okay?

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:54.890
I was just caught off balance 
for a bit, that's all.

00:10:54.890 --> 00:10:56.200
I'm glad.

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:59.870
Little boy.. Is there a big 
post office around here?

00:11:00.210 --> 00:11:03.350
This is the first time I 
came here, so I don't know.

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:04.800
Is that right?

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:07.370
Don't tell me he's going to help her?

00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:10.780
That Ryota! He doesn't have time for this.

00:11:12.590 --> 00:11:13.750
I'm going, Mr. Misumi...

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:16.100
It's Meeting Room C, isn't it?

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:17.220
I'll be right there.

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:21.820
Ryota sure is late...

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:23.960
I wonder if he got lost.

00:11:38.810 --> 00:11:41.150
Minatobashi Post Office

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:45.640
He did a good deed.

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:47.350
I'm impressed.

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:48.250
I suppose.

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:51.720
I'm glad I found the post office.

00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:54.880
He'll have to hurry, or the meeting 
will start soon, won't it?

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:55.700
That's right.

00:11:55.930 --> 00:11:56.990
I'd better hurry.

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:06.610
I lost the address to the office...

00:12:06.610 --> 00:12:07.600
What am I going to do?

00:12:07.940 --> 00:12:09.070
Remember what I told you...!

00:12:11.970 --> 00:12:15.320
If you run into any problems, open this.

00:12:17.610 --> 00:12:19.410
Great! He remembered.

00:12:23.330 --> 00:12:29.090
This is Sis' savings... 
She's always so stingy.

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:32.420
"If you lose the paper, 
look at the next page!"

00:12:33.670 --> 00:12:38.570
Use the money in here for a taxi, and tell 
the driver to take you to this address.

00:12:39.160 --> 00:12:40.400
Sis!

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:48.280
What is he doing? Hurry, and get in.

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:52.470
What is he doing?

00:12:56.190 --> 00:12:57.430
Ryota?

00:12:57.430 --> 00:12:59.610
It looks like he just asked for directions.

00:12:59.610 --> 00:13:00.700
Let's hurry.

00:13:16.530 --> 00:13:18.180
Which building is it?

00:13:18.180 --> 00:13:20.380
From the station, it's the 
building on the right.

00:13:20.640 --> 00:13:22.960
Which way is the station?

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:24.750
I'll try the one on the right.

00:13:26.780 --> 00:13:28.510
That's the building next door!

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:41.430
Do you know what floor?

00:13:41.430 --> 00:13:43.880
My dad's office is on the 27th floor.

00:13:51.520 --> 00:13:54.010
That meeting's about to start...

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:02.500
Nagisa! Nagisa!

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:03.950
What? What's wrong?

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:05.920
I have a really bad feeling mepo!

00:14:08.130 --> 00:14:09.900
There's darkness next door popo.

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:11.670
There's darkness next door...

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:15.260
Does he mean next door to 
where Nagisa's dad is...?

00:14:15.260 --> 00:14:16.230
In other words, he means 
it's in this building!

00:14:17.480 --> 00:14:18.570
Get off mepo!

00:14:22.780 --> 00:14:24.230
It stopped!

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:32.340
Welcome...

00:14:33.400 --> 00:14:34.560
I want to know...

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:37.520
I want to know...

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:39.020
What did you say?

00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:50.360
I want you to tell me about the secret of the 
power of that creature from the Field of Light!

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:52.830
Transform mepo!

00:14:55.770 --> 00:14:56.830
Stay right here.

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:57.400
Popo...

00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:05.240
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:41.780
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:15:42.140 --> 00:15:44.480
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:48.290
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:15:49.650 --> 00:15:51.700
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:55.130
Go back to where you came from!

00:15:57.420 --> 00:15:59.900
Zakenna!

00:15:59.900 --> 00:16:01.770
Zakenna!

00:16:03.450 --> 00:16:04.640
Is it an earthquake?

00:16:04.760 --> 00:16:06.880
Zakenna!

00:16:13.270 --> 00:16:16.300
Zakenna!

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:19.460
Zakenna!

00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:19.920
Popo!

00:16:19.920 --> 00:16:20.900
White!

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:22.370
Zakenna!

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:31.630
Popo!

00:16:32.610 --> 00:16:33.600
Out of my way!

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:36.070
I won't let you lay a finger on him!

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:38.550
Why do you protect him like that?

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:40.860
He's just a child!

00:16:40.860 --> 00:16:46.440
A child...? He seems like a child, 
but he's no ordinary child, is he?

00:16:48.060 --> 00:16:51.510
I want to see how he's different 
from any other child!

00:16:56.350 --> 00:16:58.930
Zakenna!

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:04.830
White!

00:17:05.090 --> 00:17:07.060
Zakenna!

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:21.980
Hang on, Black mepo!

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:27.250
That's strange...

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:29.520
It says it's on the 27th floor...

00:17:29.520 --> 00:17:30.520
What am I going to do?

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:35.510
Is the meeting going to start?

00:17:35.890 --> 00:17:37.920
All right.

00:17:38.210 --> 00:17:40.160
I'll just look outside...

00:17:42.980 --> 00:17:45.680
Dad...? Don't tell me it's 
in the other building!

00:17:48.890 --> 00:17:52.350
Too bad! I wanted to play a little longer.

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:57.600
What's wrong?

00:17:57.600 --> 00:17:58.680
Fight back!

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:00.820
Black!

00:18:07.700 --> 00:18:08.710
Are you okay?

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:11.910
You're persistent, aren't you?

00:18:12.170 --> 00:18:13.440
Zakenna!

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:16.020
Za... kenna!

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:23.740
Popo!

00:18:24.340 --> 00:18:25.230
It's hot!

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:30.150
Now tell me what that creature's secret is!

00:18:30.340 --> 00:18:32.630
I wouldn't...

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:34.590
...tell you!

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:38.060
Zakenna... more light...

00:18:40.520 --> 00:18:49.000
Don't pick on them popo!

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:02.260
Accept the power of light popo!

00:19:25.910 --> 00:19:28.980
Power of hope... Take the will of light...

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:32.340
And fight your way toward the future!

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:36.620
Pretty Cure Rainbow Storm!

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:54.870
Zakenna!

00:19:56.260 --> 00:19:58.070
Zakenna...

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:04.300
That special power... How did he...?

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:11.850
Gomenna! Gomenna! Gomenna!

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:14.020
Gomenna! Gomenna!

00:20:15.510 --> 00:20:17.420
That was close mepo.

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:19.190
Popo!

00:20:19.190 --> 00:20:20.720
Popo... popo... popo...

00:20:20.720 --> 00:20:21.610
Pollun!

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:23.380
Ryota!

00:20:23.990 --> 00:20:25.480
Dad!

00:20:25.480 --> 00:20:26.840
Ryota...

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:28.570
Here you go, Dad.

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:30.900
Right under the wire... Safe!

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:32.840
Now I can go to my meeting.

00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:34.120
Thanks, Ryota.

00:20:38.470 --> 00:20:40.210
Be careful on your way home.

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:44.090
It looks like he made it on time, didn't he?

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:45.180
Thank goodness!

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:47.850
It would have been easier to bring it myself.

00:20:48.280 --> 00:20:51.660
But thanks to you, Ryota had 
a great experience, didn't he?

00:20:51.920 --> 00:20:53.320
I hope so.

00:20:56.750 --> 00:21:00.110
But I never thought you could 
really come all by yourself.

00:21:01.810 --> 00:21:05.590
Actually, I was worried that 
you might have gotten lost.

00:21:05.590 --> 00:21:07.620
I have to give you credit.

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:09.540
Why didn't Nagisa go?

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:12.010
I was fine all by myself.

00:21:12.010 --> 00:21:13.980
You weren't alone!

00:21:13.980 --> 00:21:16.780
You've grown up, Ryota...

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:19.350
Grown up, my foot!

00:21:19.350 --> 00:21:21.420
He has no idea!

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:22.740
Thank you for the meal!

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:24.420
Are you done already?

00:21:25.060 --> 00:21:25.980
Nagisa...

00:21:31.070 --> 00:21:34.330
Thanks for today...

00:21:40.920 --> 00:21:42.910
Dad knew!

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:49.210
Do you think I'd use the money you saved?

00:21:49.210 --> 00:21:51.310
I was too afraid to use it!

00:21:52.350 --> 00:21:56.020
But I was happy that you 
did that... Thank you.

00:21:57.900 --> 00:22:00.250
Are you going to eat again, Nagisa?

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:03.940
In order to preserve my young maiden's 
beauty, I'll have to eat more.

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:05.900
That's how you're going to get all rounded...

00:22:06.140 --> 00:22:07.260
"Odamari" (be quiet)!

00:22:09.050 --> 00:22:10.240
"Hidamari" (a sunny place)!

00:22:11.050 --> 00:22:12.600
Smile brightly.

00:22:14.070 --> 00:22:16.430
I'll have to eat more.

00:22:22.160 --> 00:22:25.180
<i>Ah- Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.020 --> 00:22:29.120
<i>Get you! L-O-V-E Love Love!</i>

00:22:29.120 --> 00:22:29.880
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:29.430 --> 00:22:32.460
<i>I can't do this! I'd rather be a</i>

00:22:32.460 --> 00:22:35.500
<i>young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.500 --> 00:22:38.040
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:42.070
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.610 --> 00:22:47.850
<i>like chocolate parfait or handsome men</i>

00:22:47.850 --> 00:22:52.180
<i>I'm at the age to seriously 
fall head over heels in love</i>

00:22:52.180 --> 00:22:55.250
<i>I wanted to confess my love again today</i>

00:22:56.390 --> 00:22:59.760
<i>For the sake of the earth 
For the sake of everyone</i>

00:22:59.760 --> 00:23:06.260
<i>That's good, too, but haven't 
you forgotten something?</i>

00:23:07.370 --> 00:23:13.870
<i>I'm a teenager with a heart 
throbbing exciting dream</i>

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:20.380
<i>I don't want to lose that 
normal everyday routine</i>

00:23:20.380 --> 00:23:23.110
<i>I just can't do this! 
It's romance rather than</i>

00:23:23.110 --> 00:23:26.350
<i>stress, isn't it?</i>

00:23:26.350 --> 00:23:28.520
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode.</i>

00:23:28.520 --> 00:23:32.120
<i>Isn't that the best source of power?</i>

00:23:32.120 --> 00:23:35.330
<i>I just can't do this! I'd rather cuddle</i>

00:23:35.330 --> 00:23:38.130
<i>than fight and...</i>

00:23:38.130 --> 00:23:40.370
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:40.370 --> 00:23:43.030
<i>That's the most peaceful way</i>

00:23:43.030 --> 00:23:49.610
<i>So why am I stuffing my face 
with chocolates like this?</i>

00:23:53.250 --> 00:23:54.510
Ms. Yoshimi's getting married?

00:23:54.510 --> 00:23:57.360
I'll bet her wedding dress 
is really beautiful.

00:23:57.360 --> 00:23:58.660
A wedding dress...?

00:23:58.660 --> 00:23:59.930
I'd like to wear one once with Fuji...

00:23:59.930 --> 00:24:00.610
Fuji...?

00:24:00.610 --> 00:24:02.450
What kind of gift shall we give her?

00:24:02.450 --> 00:24:05.560
What about if our whole class gave 
her something we made ourselves?

00:24:05.560 --> 00:24:07.290
What shall we give her? Not you again!

00:24:07.290 --> 00:24:08.240
Not here!

00:24:08.240 --> 00:24:10.500
This is an important day for Ms. Yoshimi!

00:24:11.560 --> 00:24:14.770
"GLITTERING TEARS! 
POURING SWEAT! A CHAOTIC WEDDING!!"

00:24:14.770 --> 00:24:17.220
I'll have to chance at a bowl of "zenzai" 
(red bean soup with rice cakes), won't I?

00:24:17.220 --> 00:24:20.710
Are you talking about food again?
